EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hey, I just met this {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Saharah{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} chick!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}She's, like, from another country
and sells carpets!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}It takes guts to make it as a
traveling saleswoman nowadays{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I told her to take it easy!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Acabo de conocer a una tal {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Alcatifa{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Es una tía como de otro planeta,
¡y vende alfombras!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Hay que tener valor para meterse
a vendedora ambulante{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Menuda chica dura!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Hey, az önce {{TAG:0000:0003:0400}}Saharah{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} diye biriyle tanıştım!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Uzaklardan gelmiş, halı falan satıyor!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Bu devirde gezici satıcılık yapmak
cesaret ister{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ben de kendini fazla yormamasını söyledim!
